+### Shipment tracking
 
 As mentioned in the [Shipping](https://docs.stripe.com/terminal/fleet/order-and-return-readers.md#shipping) section, Stripe works with a distribution partner to fulfill Terminal orders. When our distribution partner gets tracking information for the order it transions to the `shipped` state. You can set up a webhook endpoint for the `terminal.hardware_order.shipped` notification to be notified when an order has a tracking number.
 
